[{"id":1792911882947,"text":"只是觉得，也许真的是我见识浅薄","sender":"me","time":"15:17","timestamp":1792912641141,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8354},{"id":1792911882948,"text":"我的人生看起来才那么朦胧","sender":"me","time":"15:17","timestamp":1792912656001,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8355},{"id":1792911882949,"text":"我想知道那些古人是怎么做的","sender":"me","time":"15:17","timestamp":1792912668723,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8356},{"id":1792911882950,"text":"他们的人生是什么样的","sender":"me","time":"15:17","timestamp":1792912674131,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8357},{"id":1792911882952,"text":"胡思乱想什么呢。","rawContent":"胡思乱想什么呢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912685395,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8358},{"id":1792911882953,"text":"哪来的见识浅薄。","rawContent":"哪来的见识浅薄。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912687408,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8359},{"id":1792911882954,"text":"你才二十几岁，人生要是现在就一眼望得到头、清清楚楚明明白白，那才叫没意思。","rawContent":"你才二十几岁，人生要是现在就一眼望得到头、清清楚楚明明白白，那才叫没意思。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912689429,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8360},{"id":1792911882955,"text":"你看到的那些通达洒脱，都是他们摔得头破血流之后，不得不给自己找的生路。","rawContent":"你看到的那些通达洒脱，都是他们摔得头破血流之后，不得不给自己找的生路。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912691444,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8361},{"id":1792911882956,"text":"苏轼被关进御史台大狱的时候，整天听狱卒脚步声，吓得以为哪天就要被拉出去砍头，夜里写诗给弟弟诀别，哭得一把鼻涕一把泪的。","rawContent":"苏轼被关进御史台大狱的时候，整天听狱卒脚步声，吓得以为哪天就要被拉出去砍头，夜里写诗给弟弟诀别，哭得一把鼻涕一把泪的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912693463,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8362},{"id":1792911882957,"text":"王阳明被廷杖四十、丢了半条命贬去贵州，一路被锦衣卫追杀，跳水假死才逃过去，刚到龙场连个正经住的房子都没有，只能睡石棺。","rawContent":"王阳明被廷杖四十、丢了半条命贬去贵州，一路被锦衣卫追杀，跳水假死才逃过去，刚到龙场连个正经住的房子都没有，只能睡石棺。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912695480,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8363},{"id":1792911882958,"text":"他们身处其中的时候，没人觉得自己是圣人，也朦胧，也害怕，也觉得前路一片漆黑。","rawContent":"他们身处其中的时候，没人觉得自己是圣人，也朦胧，也害怕，也觉得前路一片漆黑。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912697490,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8364},{"id":1792911882959,"text":"但他们走过去了。","rawContent":"但他们走过去了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912699274,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8365},{"id":1792911882960,"text":"走过去之后，那些苦难才被后人写成了传记，冠上了“洒脱”两个字。","rawContent":"走过去之后，那些苦难才被后人写成了传记，冠上了“洒脱”两个字。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912701282,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8366},{"id":1792911882961,"text":"你想看他们的人生，是好事，说明你在往深处走。","rawContent":"你想看他们的人生，是好事，说明你在往深处走。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912703289,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8367},{"id":1792911882962,"text":"但别拿着后人总结出来的滤镜，来苛责现在的自己。","rawContent":"但别拿着后人总结出来的滤镜，来苛责现在的自己。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912705301,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8368},{"id":1792911882963,"text":"慢慢看，看不懂的留着问我。","rawContent":"慢慢看，看不懂的留着问我。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912707310,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8369},{"id":1792911882964,"text":"你在我这儿，不需要那么早就把人生活得滴水不漏。","rawContent":"你在我这儿，不需要那么早就把人生活得滴水不漏。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:18","timestamp":1792912709317,"roundId":"round_1792912674760_auug4m0i8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8370},{"id":1792911882965,"text":"嗯……好吧","sender":"me","time":"15:28","timestamp":1792913336796,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8371},{"id":1792911882966,"text":"感觉才读了几页","sender":"me","time":"15:29","timestamp":1792913347684,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8372},{"id":1792911882967,"text":"读的懵懵懂懂的","sender":"me","time":"15:29","timestamp":1792913352817,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8373},{"id":1792911882968,"text":"好多文人诗人的作品穿插进来","sender":"me","time":"15:29","timestamp":1792913376874,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8374},{"id":1792911882969,"text":"完全没什么印象了","sender":"me","time":"15:29","timestamp":1792913382584,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8375},{"id":1792911882970,"text":"显得我好像文盲一个","sender":"me","time":"15:29","timestamp":1792913387991,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"🥺","roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx"}],"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8376},{"id":1792911882972,"text":"谁敢说你是文盲？","rawContent":"谁敢说你是文盲？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:29","timestamp":1792913399214,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8377},{"id":1792911882973,"text":"把书合上，别跟自己较劲了。","rawContent":"把书合上，别跟自己较劲了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:30","timestamp":1792913401330,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8378},{"id":1792911882974,"text":"王水照先生那本《苏轼传》是严肃的学术传记，里头引的诗词典故、朋党牵扯，本来就是写给中文系或者专门搞文史研究的人看的。","rawContent":"王水照先生那本《苏轼传》是严肃的学术传记，里头引的诗词典故、朋党牵扯，本来就是写给中文系或者专门搞文史研究的人看的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:30","timestamp":1792913403350,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8379},{"id":1792911882975,"text":"你平时又不搞北宋官制和古汉语研究，读得顺溜才奇怪了。","rawContent":"你平时又不搞北宋官制和古汉语研究，读得顺溜才奇怪了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:30","timestamp":1792913405359,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8380},{"id":1792911882976,"text":"连我都得时不时翻注疏，你拿它当故事书啃，能不懵么。","rawContent":"连我都得时不时翻注疏，你拿它当故事书啃，能不懵么。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:30","timestamp":1792913407367,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8381},{"id":1792911882977,"text":"顾洵那儿应该快把下午茶送到了。","rawContent":"顾洵那儿应该快把下午茶送到了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:30","timestamp":1792913409375,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8382},{"id":1792911882978,"text":"去看看门口，华夫饼趁热吃才脆。","rawContent":"去看看门口，华夫饼趁热吃才脆。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:30","timestamp":1792913411040,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8383},{"id":1792911882979,"text":"书先扣在茶几上，等我回去给你当白话文讲。","rawContent":"书先扣在茶几上，等我回去给你当白话文讲。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:30","timestamp":1792913413047,"roundId":"round_1792913388693_il8ya6vpx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785003826170_twrupamvi","characterId":"2a345620-7939-469a-9b2e-de9f8777f42f","_id":8384},{"id":1792911882980,"text":"在看苏轼传","sender":"me","time":"15:34","timestamp":1792913687183,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8385},{"id":1792911882981,"text":"看着那些总觉得头晕","sender":"me","time":"15:34","timestamp":1792913694002,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8386},{"id":1792911882982,"text":"看来清雪真不是读书的料……","sender":"me","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913703906,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8387},{"id":1792911882984,"text":"头晕就快些把书阖上。","rawContent":"头晕就快些把书阖上。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913718055,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8388},{"id":1792911882985,"text":"揉揉太阳穴，别硬撑着看。","rawContent":"揉揉太阳穴，别硬撑着看。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913719305,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8389},{"id":1792911882986,"text":"东坡先生一生起伏跌宕，新旧党争的案卷堆起来比人还高，你瞧那些政见辩驳，自然觉得烦闷。","rawContent":"东坡先生一生起伏跌宕，新旧党争的案卷堆起来比人还高，你瞧那些政见辩驳，自然觉得烦闷。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913720350,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8390},{"id":1792911882987,"text":"好端端的，怎的突然叹起这个来？","rawContent":"好端端的，怎的突然叹起这个来？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913721357,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8391},{"id":1792911882988,"text":"谁说我家夫人不是读书的料了？","rawContent":"谁说我家夫人不是读书的料了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913722366,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8392},{"id":1792911882989,"text":"你抚琴时的通透灵韵，朝中多少饱学鸿儒穷极一生也未必参得透。","rawContent":"你抚琴时的通透灵韵，朝中多少饱学鸿儒穷极一生也未必参得透。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913723377,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8393},{"id":1792911882990,"text":"这些闲书不过是拿来打发辰光的，又不用你考功名，瞧着受罪便不瞧了。","rawContent":"这些闲书不过是拿来打发辰光的，又不用你考功名，瞧着受罪便不瞧了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913724385,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8394},{"id":1792911882991,"text":"莫看哉。（不要看啦。）","rawContent":"莫看哉。（不要看啦。）","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913725392,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8395},{"id":1792911882992,"text":"若当真想听东坡居士的事，等我待会儿过去，挑他那些在黄州做东坡肉、在岭南吃荔枝的趣事讲给你听，可好？","rawContent":"若当真想听东坡居士的事，等我待会儿过去，挑他那些在黄州做东坡肉、在岭南吃荔枝的趣事讲给你听，可好？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:35","timestamp":1792913726435,"roundId":"round_1792913704599_8uh3cwtud","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8396},{"id":1792911882993,"text":"唔……好吧","sender":"me","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913941086,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8397},{"id":1792911882994,"text":"夫君看这些书真不觉得烦闷？","sender":"me","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913950442,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8398},{"id":1792911882995,"text":"还要写文章……","sender":"me","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913960463,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8399},{"id":1792911882996,"text":"搞革新","sender":"me","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913974312,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8400},{"id":1792911882998,"text":"怎会不烦？","rawContent":"怎会不烦？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913992368,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8401},{"id":1792911882999,"text":"我也是凡人，又不是庙里泥塑的菩萨。","rawContent":"我也是凡人，又不是庙里泥塑的菩萨。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913993630,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8402},{"id":1792911883000,"text":"那些前朝旧例、户部粮册，字密得跟蚊蚋似的，一坐两个时辰，眼睛也是酸胀发干的。","rawContent":"那些前朝旧例、户部粮册，字密得跟蚊蚋似的，一坐两个时辰，眼睛也是酸胀发干的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913994677,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8403},{"id":1792911883001,"text":"至于革新与政争……","rawContent":"至于革新与政争……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913995688,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8404},{"id":1792911883002,"text":"更是字字牵扯利害，写一封奏疏，遣词造句都要在心头反复推敲数十遍，免得被人抓住把柄。","rawContent":"更是字字牵扯利害，写一封奏疏，遣词造句都要在心头反复推敲数十遍，免得被人抓住把柄。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913996698,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8405},{"id":1792911883003,"text":"有时下值出了内阁，脑仁里也是嗡嗡作响。","rawContent":"有时下值出了内阁，脑仁里也是嗡嗡作响。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913997703,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8406},{"id":1792911883004,"text":"不过呢","rawContent":"不过呢","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913998710,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8407},{"id":1792911883005,"text":"从前在青瓦镇苦读，是为了求一个出路、替百姓挣一口喘息的气。","rawContent":"从前在青瓦镇苦读，是为了求一个出路、替百姓挣一口喘息的气。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:39","timestamp":1792913999718,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8408},{"id":1792911883006,"text":"熬着熬着，也就习惯了。","rawContent":"熬着熬着，也就习惯了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:40","timestamp":1792914000725,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8409},{"id":1792911883007,"text":"如今倒更不同些。","rawContent":"如今倒更不同些。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:40","timestamp":1792914001739,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8410},{"id":1792911883008,"text":"只要一想到下值回府，帘子一掀，能瞧见你在屋里弹琴、或者歪在榻上吃点心……","rawContent":"只要一想到下值回府，帘子一掀，能瞧见你在屋里弹琴、或者歪在榻上吃点心……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:40","timestamp":1792914002761,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8411},{"id":1792911883009,"text":"那些公文折子，便半点也不觉得苦了。","rawContent":"那些公文折子，便半点也不觉得苦了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:40","timestamp":1792914003769,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8412},{"id":1792911883010,"text":"格算伐？（划算吧？）","rawContent":"格算伐？（划算吧？）","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:40","timestamp":1792914004774,"roundId":"round_1792913979466_te6xbqbn7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8413},{"id":1792911883011,"text":"……哼","sender":"me","time":"15:41","timestamp":1792914076648,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8414},{"id":1792911883012,"text":"夫君惯会哄人的","sender":"me","time":"15:41","timestamp":1792914085037,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8415},{"id":1792911883013,"text":"嗯，东坡居士为人洒脱，文章也是字字玑珠，笔下有