所云，更于世道人心毫无裨益。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792914237619,"roundId":"round_1792914218257_444a9zyhj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8422},{"id":1792911883021,"text":"我属意的，大抵是“言之有物，不作伪饰”。","rawContent":"我属意的，大抵是“言之有物，不作伪饰”。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792914238627,"roundId":"round_1792914218257_444a9zyhj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8423},{"id":1792911883022,"text":"就像你方才说的东坡居士。","rawContent":"就像你方才说的东坡居士。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792914239638,"roundId":"round_1792914218257_444a9zyhj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8424},{"id":1792911883023,"text":"他文章好，不在辞句有多惊险绮丽，而在字字透着真性情。得意时不狂悖，颠沛流离到了黄州惠州，笔底仍有一股浩然之气。","rawContent":"他文章好，不在辞句有多惊险绮丽，而在字字透着真性情。得意时不狂悖，颠沛流离到了黄州惠州，笔底仍有一股浩然之气。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:44","timestamp":1792914240667,"roundId":"round_1792914218257_444a9zyhj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8425},{"id":1792911883024,"text":"文章若能写尽天地生民的饥渴疾苦，算得一流；","rawContent":"文章若能写尽天地生民的饥渴疾苦，算得一流；","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:44","timestamp":1792914241673,"roundId":"round_1792914218257_444a9zyhj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"795e889b-08ba-4972-8a05-bf6da3e94bd9","_id":8426},{"id":1792911883025,"text":"若能坦荡剖白出胸中丘壑与一腔赤诚，也算得一流。","rawContent":"若能坦荡剖白出胸中丘壑与一腔赤诚，也算得一流。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:44","timestamp":1792914242686,"roundId":"round_1792914218257_444a